WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.460
The summit between the leaders of North and South Korea

2
00:00:02.460 --> 00:00:03.293
ended on Sunday.

3
00:00:03.293 --> 00:00:05.210
That's pretty compelling to watch that go down.

4
00:00:05.210 --> 00:00:06.390
A lot of people felt we'd never see

5
00:00:06.390 --> 00:00:07.364
this happen.
Right.

6
00:00:07.364 --> 00:00:10.330
And one of the most striking images was this shot

7
00:00:10.330 --> 00:00:14.180
of North Korea's Kim Jong-un arriving at the summit

8
00:00:14.180 --> 00:00:16.230
with body guards running along side his limousine.

9
00:00:16.230 --> 00:00:17.080
I don't know if you saw this.

10
00:00:17.080 --> 00:00:19.210
This was absolutely.
(laughing)

11
00:00:19.210 --> 00:00:22.490
Absolutely blew my mind when they showed up.

12
00:00:22.490 --> 00:00:24.920
Yeah, and everyone was just blown away by that. (claps)

13
00:00:24.920 --> 00:00:26.616
Now that seems like a lot of security.

14
00:00:26.616 --> 00:00:27.850
I know.

15
00:00:27.850 --> 00:00:30.610
But if you're in the public eye trust me you cannot be

16
00:00:30.610 --> 00:00:31.590
too careful.

17
00:00:31.590 --> 00:00:36.020
In fact true story Warner Brothers gave me my own security

18
00:00:36.020 --> 00:00:37.780
detail.
(laughing)

19
00:00:37.780 --> 00:00:40.557
Don't giggle it's necessary.
(laughing)

20
00:00:40.557 --> 00:00:44.112
I'm an iconic figure in America.

21
00:00:44.112 --> 00:00:45.280
(laughing)

22
00:00:45.280 --> 00:00:47.420
Billy let's show the footage of me coming back from lunch

23
00:00:47.420 --> 00:00:49.170
today at the commissary.

24
00:00:49.170 --> 00:00:50.263
(laughs)
Okay, that's me.

25
00:00:51.129 --> 00:00:52.376
(clapping)
Coming back

26
00:00:52.376 --> 00:00:56.293
from the commissary.
(cheering)

27
00:00:57.583 --> 00:01:01.690
Then I realized I forgot to get ketchup packets

28
00:01:01.690 --> 00:01:03.150
at the commissary.

29
00:01:03.150 --> 00:01:05.987
So I'm headed back and then a fan tried to get a selfie.

30
00:01:05.987 --> 00:01:08.530
But we took care of him.
(laughing)

31
00:01:08.530 --> 00:01:10.520
This is the way you have to.

32
00:01:10.520 --> 00:01:13.853
(cheering and clapping)

33
00:01:21.250 --> 00:01:22.270
You started to lose

34
00:01:22.270 --> 00:01:23.390
them at the end.
I know trust me.

35
00:01:23.390 --> 00:01:25.440
You're accelerating.
We had to get that

36
00:01:25.440 --> 00:01:28.023
in one take.(laughs)
(laughing)

37
00:01:30.990 --> 00:01:32.270
The director was like should we do it again.

38
00:01:32.270 --> 00:01:33.775
I'm like I don't think we should do it again.

39
00:01:33.775 --> 00:01:35.090
(laughing)

40
00:01:35.090 --> 00:01:36.440
Gertrude can't handle that.

